title: "Bubble dynamics: a single gas bubble in an ultrasonic or megasonic sound field, Rayleigh-Plesset and Keller-Miksis equations and the cavitation threshold"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Ishaque
    given-names: Hashim
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-20
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/hashimishaque-platform/bubble-dynamics"
